  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your knee gets in the way of deadly elemental energies and pays the price. For a moment your lower leg remains attached to the upper, and then they part ways in a puff of ash!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3) and @Condition[Prone]. You lose the leg – @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.k00PimCWkff11IA0]{Amputation (Hard)}. The charred and skinless stump also causes you to contract a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.kKccDTGzWzSXCBOb]{Festering Wound}.</p>"
    },
